   "html": "<div class=\"dpw\"><div class=\"dpk\">百貨店の店舗別の売上（2026年2月期・3月期）</div><div class=\"dpt\">1位は<em>伊勢丹新宿本店</em></div><div class=\"dpr\"><div class=\"dpn\">1</div><img class=\"dpi\" src=\"photos/isetan.jpg\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"dpb\"><div class=\"dpnm\">伊勢丹新宿本店</div><div class=\"dpv\">4,250億円</div><div class=\"dps\">東京・新宿</div></div></div><div class=\"dpr\"><div class=\"dpn\">2</div><img class=\"dpi\" src=\"photos/hankyu.jpg\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"dpb\"><div class=\"dpnm\">阪急本店</div><div class=\"dpv\">3,487億円</div><div class=\"dps\">大阪・梅田</div></div></div><div class=\"dpr\"><div class=\"dpn\">3</div><img class=\"dpi\" src=\"photos/takashimaya.jpg\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"dpb\"><div class=\"dpnm\">高島屋大阪店</div><div class=\"dpv\">1,799億円</div><div class=\"dps\">大阪・難波</div></div></div><div class=\"dpf\">年1,000億円を超える店は<b>全国で12店</b>。うち<b>4店が高島屋</b></div></div>",
